background:
  color: $paper
  type: solid
pageType: content
notes: 阶段一格式分拣与阶段二内容提取
elements:
  - bounds: [64, 38, 400, 16]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      text: PART 02 · PIPELINE
      wrap: false
    elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 60, 832, 40]
    content:
      style: $title
      text: 阶段 1-2：不管什么格式，先统一成文本
      wrap: false
    elementId: title
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 108, 832, 1]
    elementId: rule
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $line, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [64, 132, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      text: 阶段一 · 格式分拣
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-s1
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 160, 360, 200]
    elementId: box-s1
    elementType: shape
    fill: {color: $beige, type: solid}
    shapeName: rect
  - bounds: [80, 174, 328, 176]
    content:
      style: $body
      fontSize: 12
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>· 按扩展名初分：<span style="color:$gray">.xlsx/.xls → excel；.txt/.csv → text；.jpg/.png → image</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· <strong>PDF 二次判定</strong>：pdfplumber 读首页，可提取字符 &gt; 100 → 电子版，否则 → 扫描件</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px">· 不支持的格式记入错误清单，<span style="color:$orange"><strong>不中断整批</strong></span></p>
    elementId: box-s1-t
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 380, 360, 80]
    content:
      style: $mono
      fontSize: 11
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>设计取舍：报价单没有固定的"明细栏区域"，</p>
        <p>格式自由度极高，所以不做区域定位 ——</p>
        <p>统一走"全文提取 → LLM 理解"路线。</p>
    elementId: note-s1
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [464, 132, 200, 18]
    content:
      style: $kicker
      fontSize: 10
      text: 阶段二 · 内容提取
      wrap: false
    elementId: label-s2
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [464, 160, 432, 240]
    columnWidths: [0.3, 0.7]
    elementId: table-extract
    elementType: table
    rowHeights: [0.16, 0.168, 0.168, 0.168, 0.168, 0.168]
    rows:
      - - text: 输入类型
        - text: 提取方式
      - - text: excel
        - text: 逐 sheet 转 Markdown 表格，保留单元格原值
      - - text: pdf_digital
        - text: pdfplumber 抽文本层 + 表格线，两者都保留
      - - text: pdf_scanned
        - text: 300 DPI 转图 → OpenCV 矫正 → RapidOCR 识别
      - - text: image
        - text: 同扫描件 OCR 管线，低置信行记录在案
      - - text: text
        - text: 直接读取，chardet 自动识别编码
    style: $mono
  - bounds: [464, 418, 432, 42]
    content:
      style: $small
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>统一输出 <span style="font-family:JetBrains Mono; color:$green">raw_text</span> JSON 落盘：源文件、类型、原文文本、提取警告 —— 这一阶段不做任何业务理解。</p>
    elementId: note-s2
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [64, 478, 560, 16]
    content:
      style: $small
      text: 技术分享 · 报价单提取比价工具
      wrap: false
    elementId: footer
    elementType: text
  - bounds: [860, 478, 36, 16]
    content:
      style: $mono
      fontSize: 12
      align: [right, top]
      text: '09'
      wrap: false
    elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
